  "title": "X to Xray",
  "description": "An Powerfull Open-Source Xray Mod That Allows You To See Ores And More By Pressing X!",
  "body": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5e41c5c16a843aeb9470d421928a597dfb7aa0bd.png\" alt=\"Banner\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" />\n  <br /><br />\n\n  <table align=\"center\" style=\"border: none; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <tr style=\"border: none;\">\n      <td style=\"border: none; padding: 0 5px;\">\n        <a href=\"https://discord.gg/E5fkjKUgWJ\" target=\"_blank\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2b44803205849fbce75a7ef7819e4a0c8fa23cab_0.webp\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"160\" />\n        </a>\n      </td>\n      <td style=\"border: none; padding: 0 5px;\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/x-to-xray\" target=\"_blank\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5c1b28e9b83b8affc83d2d911911d41442ae3516_0.webp\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"160\" />\n        </a>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</p>\n\n### Pluginversion Available [Here!](https://modrinth.com/plugin/server-xtoxray)\n<!-- WICHTIGER HINWEIS -->\n<p><strong>Please note:</strong> The mod <em>X To Xray</em> does not allow you to use Xray on all servers. Xray will only function if the server-side mod is installed on the server as well.</p>\n\n<br />\n\n<!-- DROPDOWN 1: HOW TO USE -->\n<details>\n  <summary style=\"font-size: 1.2em; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; padding: 5px;\">How To Use</summary>\n  <div style=\"padding: 10px; border-left: 3px solid #5c1b28; margin-top: 5px;\">\n    <ol>\n      <li>Download the mod and the Fabric API.</li>\n      <li>Download the Fabric Loader.</li>\n      <li>Put all downloaded files into your <code>mods</code> folder.</li>\n      <li>Start Minecraft.</li>\n    </ol>\n  </div>\n</details>\n\n<br />\n\n<!-- DROPDOWN 2: HOW TO SETUP ON SERVER -->\n<details>\n  <summary style=\"font-size: 1.2em; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; padding: 5px;\">How To Setup On Server</summary>\n  <div style=\"padding: 10px; border-left: 3px solid #2b4480; margin-top: 5px;\">\n    <p>To set up the mod on a server, follow these steps:</p>\n    <ol>\n      <li>First, create a server using the Fabric server software.</li>\n      <li>Download the <em>X To Xray</em> mod (any version).</li>\n      <li>Install the Fabric API on the server.</li>\n      <li>Install Xray on your client (your own Minecraft) and join the server.</li>\n    </ol>\n    <p><em>Reminder: Xray will only work if this server-side mod is fully installed on the server.</em></p>\n  </div>\n</details>\n\n<br />\n",
